# Options list (row Audio) -> Wireless Controller (3 DOWN) -> page: Control Mapping RIGHT, Y-axis RIGHT, then Advanced Settings.
key DOWN
sleep 1.5
key DOWN
sleep 1.5
key DOWN
sleep 1.5
key X
wait controllersettings.gum
sleep 3
mark controller page default
key RIGHT
sleep 2.5
mark control mapping changed
key DOWN
sleep 1.5
key RIGHT
sleep 2.5
mark y-axis changed
key DOWN
sleep 1.5
key X
wait advancedcontroller.gum
sleep 3
mark advanced settings page
